Valid `extract_symbol` for a class:
```xml
<action>
{
  "type": "extract_symbol",
  "path": "app/src/main/java/com/example/feature/ViewModel.kt",
  "symbol_name": "ActivityTrackerViewModel",
  "symbol_kind": "class",
  "include_signature": true,
  "include_body": true,
